{"id":"vod_md_4882","vodId":"4882","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"高达创形者 再起第二季","name_cn":"高达创形者 再起第二季","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230914-1/2c84be2a62a6f1957194ff4ce3945361.jpg"},"summary":"传说中的部队——创形者队拯救了EL潜行者的第2次志愿者联盟战已经过去两年。曾经的战场——高达模型联网对战（GBN）在经过版本升级后，加入了感觉反馈功能，代入感也得到进一步提升。不过也有很多潜行者并非出于跟风，而是怀揣各自想法进入这一世界。悠人是个扮演着佣兵，独自徘徊于次元世界空间的潜行者。风见孤傲轻佻，梦想受众人崇拜，穿梭在不同团队。芽依从早到晚进行高达模型对战，是个浑身散发神秘气息的独行侠。孤独的新人帕维兹对合作玩法深感兴趣，却因为内向至今未能得偿所愿。这些原本孤独的玩家，却因为某个契机，组成另一支「创形者」了。等待着悠人他们的，是超越GBN的无极限超体验。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-14 07:39:20","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/o4JBfOS0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/mYXA4Cf3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/TAL6tAwu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/gFz1MKft/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/Qz8HSJ1T/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/2t9lKYtX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/AA4dmVd8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/mN5xHrZk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/MdmDqwjP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/4h2c0cZC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/T2ic9f2J/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/MQLSBtyb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230912/KjI3sgkZ/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T07:56:00.136Z"}